          "thread": "LVR and MEV LP protection",
          "why": "Multiple high-click headlines center on CoW AMM, HOT, and FM-AMM designs that eliminate loss-vs-rebalancing for LPs — readers are drawn to the framing that the dominant AMM model structurally disadvantages the people providing the liquidity."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Oracle-free lending inside AMMs",
          "why": "Frax's BAMM attracted significant attention by rewriting lending primitives — borrowing excess LP liquidity without price oracles is a genuinely novel mechanism that drew readers seeking the underlying math and implications."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "New AMM protocol launches",
          "why": "PumpSwap hitting Solana's #2 volume slot within days, Balancer's brand refresh, and Sushi's Aptos integration all drove clicks on the angle of competitive displacement in AMM market share."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Impermanent loss as structural flaw",
          "why": "Egorov's Stable Summit reframing — IL is not a side effect but a design consequence of sqrt-price scaling — and the Astrovault CEO's Uniswap sustainability warning resonated with readers ready to question foundational assumptions."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "AMM exploit and overflow attacks",
          "why": "The Cetus $200M drain via a liquidity calculation overflow drew readers because it exposed how a single arithmetic edge case in LP position math can be weaponized to empty pools with minimal capital."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "AMM price anomalies and market efficiency",
          "why": "The $SQUID auction arbitrage — where AMM price implied a 1000x market cap discrepancy — pulled readers who wanted to understand whether the result exposed AMM mispricing or rational expectations failure."
        }
      ]
